after what feels like forever daniel  craig swanson as british secret agent  james bond is approaching he has  everything we know about no time to die  the 25th bond film no time to die was  originally scheduled for release in  november 2019 but when original director  danny boyle dropped out due to creative  differences it was pushed back twice  then covert 19 arrived and no time to  die was delayed to april 2021 becoming  the first tentpole movie from a major  franchise to be delayed due to covert  19. finally universal pushed no time to  dive back once again to october 8th  betting that more movie theaters will be  open in the fall no time to die has a  big cast with many returning characters  along with some exciting new additions  many 007 franchise mainstays will be  back including ray fines as m ben wishaw  as q naomi harris as money penny rory  kinnear as tanner jeffrey wright as cia  agent felix leiter and leia cedu as mi6  psychiatrist madeleine swann christophe  vaults will also be reprising his role  as fillon and stavro blofeld who was  captured at the end of spectre and is  now in mi6 custody newcomers include  bohemian rhapsody star rami malik who  will be playing the villain of no time  to die he actually named lutz di safin  lashana lynch will play nomi a new  double o agent who joined mi6 after  band's retirement and anna de armas will  play paloma a cia agent who teams up  with bond to battle saffin those behind  the camera are just as important as  those in front of it when it comes to  film and television projects kerry joji  fukunaga the genius behind true  detective season 1 directed no time to  die this marks the first bond film for  the director for which he also co-wrote  the screenplay alongside neil purvis  robert wade and flea bags phoebe waller  bridge purvis and wade work together on  the screenplays for the world is not  enough die another day casino royale  quantum of solace skyfall and spectre it  would have been shocking not to see  their names on the credits and  thankfully they were fully on board to  write daniel craig's last film as  double-oh-seven the film is also  executive produced by chris brigham who  boasts work like inception and argo you  also can't have bond without producer  barbara broccoli whose second credit  ever was licensed to kill and has worked  on every bond production since the past  isn't dead  the trailer gives us a few hints of what  to expect from the movie years after the  events of spectre a retired 007 is  recruited by his old ally felix lighter  for one more mission soon bond discovers  that a man named saffin is behind a plot  that could kill millions of people as  for what saffin super villain schemers  specifically we'll have to wait until  october to find out in terms of themes  fukunaka believes that no time to die is  the culmination of all bond has become  daniel craig's james bond has been  through a lot from the death of his  lover and casino royale to the  destruction of his childhood home in  skyfall it appears that craig's final  chapter as bond will see the character  confronting his many many demons and  possibly getting something like closure  until the next bond comes along anyway  this will be the final chapter for  daniel craig the daniel craig led  doubles seven films are widely popular  for their theme songs which always  managed to capture each movie's overall  tone adele skyfall theme was an academy  award winner and sam smith also nabbed  an oscar for his spectre theme song  writings on the wall it's no surprise  that no time to die will feature a theme  song by one of the decade's most  prominent artists billy eilish the young  singer provides the vocals for the song  also titled no time to die the track was  released in october 2020 putting its  debut and the films almost one year  apart additionally the great han zimmer  serves as a composer of no time to die  marking the legendary musician's first  work on a bond film  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite movies are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]
 

